Intellectual Property Notice
-----------------------------
This software embodies novel methods, architectures, and techniques for
machine vision-based screenshot understanding and structured LLM context
generation, including but not limited to:

  - A 5-stage deterministic pipeline for converting screenshots to
    structured LLM-ready context (preprocessing → detection → OCR →
    layout analysis → context assembly)
  - A hybrid UI-element detector combining fine-tuned RT-DETR with a
    rule-based fallback system
  - A tiered runtime architecture (lite / standard) for deployment-aware
    pipeline selection
  - A ContextPack output schema with multi-format serialization
    (JSON, Markdown, System Prompt) optimized for LLM injection

